  "ai.orion81Completely": "<0>Orion-81 dwg aen hanghmoeg cienzbouh AI cauxguh.<\/0> Moix hangz daimaj Orion-81 gag cungj aeu Claude Code sij, youz vunz laeb dingh. Moix aen ruz, deihdoz, doz mbaw caeuq sing cungj youz gij gunghgiz Claude Code sij cauxguh. Vunz laeb dingh aeu guh gijmaz; Claude Code ngeix baenzlawz guh. Gij daimaj hai goek de dwk youq lajneix, youq 'Mbouj dwg AI guh'. Lij miz aen hangh ndeu mbouj liux, cuengq youq gwnz: <1>genjcaz hawjndaej<\/1> gij daimaj youzyi daj aen yiengh sawq GPL gvaq daeuj.",
